WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:43.710
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:43.980 --> 00:45.005
Huh?

3
00:45.005 --> 00:47.037
My alumna, Shin Bi Gyeong?

4
00:47.037 --> 00:49.300
Hello, it's 2013.

5
00:49.300 --> 00:51.163
2013?

6
00:51.163 --> 00:55.385
Did the rain trigger another time leap?

7
00:55.385 --> 00:57.304
Huh? Ye Rang...

8
00:57.304 --> 00:58.500
and Jun Mo!

9
00:58.500 --> 01:00.223
Bottoms up.

10
01:00.223 --> 01:03.211
- Let's hand it over to reporter Yoon Ha Na. - Yoon Ha Na?

11
01:03.211 --> 01:06.042
- Yoon Ha Na? - Reporter Yoon Ha Na...

12
01:06.042 --> 01:07.710
Did you just call me...

13
01:07.710 --> 01:10.110
Yoon Ha Na?

14
01:11.143 --> 01:13.309
It's me!

15
01:13.309 --> 01:15.332
It's Yoon Ha Na!

16
01:18.784 --> 01:20.574
But why 2013?

17
01:20.574 --> 01:23.514
Why not 2026? Why is it 2013?

18
01:23.514 --> 01:24.998
What's wrong, Ha Na?

19
01:24.998 --> 01:26.401
You alright, Ha Na?

20
01:26.401 --> 01:28.494
I'd be 21 in 2013...

21
01:28.494 --> 01:30.272
So, if he's 21...

22
01:30.272 --> 01:32.785
Woo Jae must be serving in the army.

23
01:35.935 --> 01:37.619
- Hey, Yoon Ha Na! - Yoon Ha Na!

24
01:37.619 --> 01:39.319
Hey, where are you going?

25
01:41.040 --> 01:43.211
She must be drunk.

26
01:43.211 --> 01:45.912
Oh, right. Jun Mo.

27
01:45.912 --> 01:50.215
When are the audition results for the female lead coming out?

28
01:50.215 --> 01:51.906
It's still under evaluation by the professor.

29
01:51.906 --> 01:53.068
But soon, I think.

30
01:53.068 --> 01:54.291
Oh, I see.

31
01:54.291 --> 01:57.096
Hey, it's not even that promising a script.

32
01:57.096 --> 01:58.490
What's with the delay, huh?

33
01:58.490 --> 02:02.136
He's a, uh, he's an odd one, you hear?

34
02:03.898 --> 02:05.801
Why is this happening?

35
02:05.801 --> 02:08.123
What went wrong?

36
02:08.123 --> 02:11.499
[Beast] Why won't he answer?

37
02:13.770 --> 02:15.417
Oh, my purse!

38
02:15.417 --> 02:16.508
Thief!

39
02:16.508 --> 02:19.260
- Move! - It's a thief! A thief!

40
02:21.509 --> 02:22.665
Move!

41
02:22.665 --> 02:25.065
- He's a thief! - Out of the way!

42
02:26.226 --> 02:28.302
You're not going anywhere!

43
02:29.396 --> 02:31.138
Piss off!

44
02:36.512 --> 02:38.052
Let go!

45
02:40.498 --> 02:41.522
Are you alright?

46
02:41.522 --> 02:43.417
Woo Jae!

47
02:48.001 --> 02:50.662
- Let go! - Stay down, you scum!

48
02:50.662 --> 02:52.446
Are you hurt?

49
03:04.344 --> 03:06.574
- Cheers! - Cheers!

50
03:06.574 --> 03:08.521
- Enjoy your meal. - Thank you.

51
03:08.521 --> 03:10.921
- A bottle of soju, please. - A soju, coming right up!

52
03:34.581 --> 03:35.910
[10:46 PM] [2013/05/31 Friday]

53
03:41.814 --> 03:43.269
[Yoon's Raw Fish Restaurant]

54
03:46.640 --> 03:48.756
What are you delaying for? We're busy enough as is!

55
03:48.756 --> 03:51.211
- Mom! - Seriously!

56
03:51.211 --> 03:52.586
Hi, Mom...

57
03:54.030 --> 03:56.768
- What am I doing here? - Oh, my!

58
03:56.768 --> 03:58.326
You still haven't prepared these?

59
03:58.326 --> 03:59.862
Really, what have you been doing?

60
03:59.862 --> 04:01.098
What?

61
04:01.706 --> 04:03.228
How would I even do this?

62
04:03.228 --> 04:04.361
I've never done this before!

63
04:04.361 --> 04:07.424
What are you on about?

64
04:07.424 --> 04:10.588
You've been hacking off fish heads all day, see that pile?

65
04:10.588 --> 04:13.583
Come up with a better excuse next time.

66
04:13.583 --> 04:15.093
Hey, you. Go to Seoul.

67
04:15.093 --> 04:17.536
I'm taking an hour's worth of wages off of today's shift.

68
04:20.932 --> 04:22.424
Shift?

69
04:22.424 --> 04:24.037
What shift?

70
04:26.853 --> 04:28.620
Am I working part-time here?

71
04:29.210 --> 04:31.093
You said, once you graduate culinary school,

72
04:31.093 --> 04:34.434
you'll open a restaurant in Gangnam and make us proud.

73
04:34.434 --> 04:38.198
Proud, my butt. I'm more concerned about you blowing your tuition.

74
04:39.557 --> 04:41.354
Restaurant?

75
04:42.061 --> 04:43.530
Bodyguard?

76
04:43.530 --> 04:45.178
Yeah.

77
04:53.852 --> 04:55.233
[Beast]

78
04:56.162 --> 04:57.902
One moment.

79
04:57.902 --> 04:59.408
Okay.

80
05:02.747 --> 05:04.533
What took you so long?

81
05:04.533 --> 05:05.979
Yoon Ha Ru, where are you right now?

82
05:05.979 --> 05:07.847
Working part-time at our parents' restaurant.

83
05:07.847 --> 05:09.609
I'm not a judo player.

84
05:09.609 --> 05:12.133
I gave up... on judo.

85
05:12.133 --> 05:13.378
What?

86
05:14.371 --> 05:15.813
Where are you?

87
05:15.813 --> 05:17.238
I'm near the campus.

88
05:17.238 --> 05:19.323
And I'm me, Yoon Ha Na. I'm in my body.

89
05:19.323 --> 05:20.570
Well, me too.

90
05:20.570 --> 05:22.798
I'm Yoon Ha Ru, myself.

91
05:22.798 --> 05:24.281
It's 2013...

92
05:24.281 --> 05:27.482
I'm in the class of 2012 at Yongwon University, a sophomore in film. You?

93
05:27.482 --> 05:29.869
I'm studying culinary arts at Yongwon.

94
05:29.869 --> 05:32.939
I'm a freshman. Class of 2013.

95
05:33.572 --> 05:35.062
Woo Jae isn't a national player, either.

96
05:35.062 --> 05:37.089
Security services, Yongwon, class of 2012...

97
05:37.089 --> 05:39.075
Nothing's going as we expected.

98
05:39.075 --> 05:40.440
Yeah, no joke.

99
05:40.440 --> 05:42.881
Let's talk in person.

100
05:42.881 --> 05:46.654
Yeah, I'll take the first train leaving tomorrow.

101
05:58.546 --> 06:00.582
Are you done?

102
06:00.582 --> 06:03.437
Yeah, Ha Ru seems busy.

103
06:03.437 --> 06:04.588
Of course.

104
06:04.588 --> 06:06.846
There are always lots of customers at this hour.

105
06:06.846 --> 06:08.971
- Let's go. - Huh?

106
06:09.850 --> 06:11.227
Okay...

107
06:39.691 --> 06:41.229
[2012 National Judo Tournament]

108
06:59.293 --> 07:01.411
Hey, kiddo.

109
07:02.690 --> 07:04.791
Kiddo.

110
07:04.791 --> 07:06.516
Dad?

111
07:06.516 --> 07:08.882
You trouble-making, naughty, mischievous little bastard...

112
07:08.882 --> 07:11.741
Can't even bother to stand up at your father's grand arrival?

113
07:12.495 --> 07:14.096
Are you drunk?

114
07:14.096 --> 07:17.058
No, I'm not... Hey! Get up!

115
07:17.058 --> 07:19.294
I... Okay.

116
07:20.323 --> 07:22.230
Attention.

117
07:22.230 --> 07:24.792
Don't you dare use your judo skills on me.

118
07:24.792 --> 07:27.092
Stay still. Arms at your side...

119
07:27.735 --> 07:30.832
Aw, my cutie-pie little sonny boy...

120
07:32.240 --> 07:34.978
What's wrong with you?

121
07:40.848 --> 07:42.707
Oh, you...

122
07:43.543 --> 07:45.363
My boy.

123
07:50.249 --> 07:52.719
How's school going?

124
07:52.719 --> 07:55.096
How's your cooking?

125
07:55.096 --> 07:58.799
You must be standing up all day in the kitchen.

126
07:58.799 --> 08:00.614
Are your legs alright?

127
08:05.940 --> 08:08.759
Yeah, it's fine, I think.

128
08:10.607 --> 08:13.068
Cooking's not easy, you know...

129
08:13.068 --> 08:18.020
Hey, I heard they run kitchens like the army. They've got nags and bullies, right?

130
08:18.020 --> 08:19.395
I say...

131
08:19.395 --> 08:22.163
if anyone tries to bully you, let me know right away.

132
08:22.163 --> 08:24.667
I'll go there and take care of stuff!

133
08:24.667 --> 08:27.212
I'm not a kid anymore!

134
08:27.212 --> 08:29.839
Dad, this is Yoon Ha Ru we're talking about.

135
08:29.839 --> 08:31.466
Bullying?

136
08:31.466 --> 08:32.884
I doubt I'd care.

137
08:32.884 --> 08:35.284
I mean, I won't!

138
08:35.884 --> 08:37.751
Stop worrying.

139
08:46.356 --> 08:48.358
Deary me.

140
08:48.358 --> 08:52.102
I don't recall you growing up so fast.

141
08:53.738 --> 08:55.823
I remember when you used to waddle...

142
08:55.823 --> 08:59.452
and refuse to leave my side like it was yesterday.

143
08:59.452 --> 09:02.872
And now you're saying you'll become a great cook,

144
09:02.872 --> 09:05.272
and make us proud.

145
09:07.293 --> 09:10.338
Not a cook, a chef.

146
09:10.338 --> 09:12.155
Yeah, yeah.

147
09:12.155 --> 09:15.012
- Cook. - No, a chef...

148
09:17.929 --> 09:19.531
Sure.

149
09:21.599 --> 09:23.688
- Dad. - Yeah?

150
09:25.691 --> 09:30.021
Remember why I quit judo?

151
09:32.148 --> 09:34.603
Of course I do.

152
09:34.603 --> 09:37.147
How would I forget?

153
09:38.354 --> 09:41.774
They said the surgery went great.

154
09:41.774 --> 09:45.263
So we all thought you'd make a full recovery and jump straight back into judo...

155
09:49.377 --> 09:50.992
Oh, boy.

156
09:56.710 --> 10:01.955
If he keeps competing, he might lose the ability to walk.

157
10:01.955 --> 10:05.173
I wouldn't recommend that he keep playing judo.

158
10:05.173 --> 10:06.803
Dad...

159
10:09.093 --> 10:10.899
My boy...

160
10:11.804 --> 10:13.278
It's okay.

161
10:18.989 --> 10:21.297
Cry as much as you want, my boy.

162
10:25.226 --> 10:27.652
You know, I really...

163
10:27.652 --> 10:30.865
I'm a man of simple wishes.

164
10:30.865 --> 10:32.950
I just want you two...

165
10:32.950 --> 10:36.570
Ha Ru and Ha Na...

166
10:37.325 --> 10:41.376
to stay healthy, like right now.

167
10:41.376 --> 10:44.281
All would be well if you two are well.

168
10:44.997 --> 10:47.491
I, Yoon Chang Sik...

169
10:47.491 --> 10:49.891
want nothing else in life.

170
10:53.495 --> 10:55.675
Hey, come on. Pour me a shot.

171
10:55.675 --> 10:57.223
Okay.

172
11:07.046 --> 11:08.680
How sweet is that?

173
11:09.521 --> 11:10.985
How sweet...

174
11:14.238 --> 11:15.910
When is he coming?

175
11:15.910 --> 11:18.471
He's taking the first train here tomorrow.

176
11:19.831 --> 11:23.587
I'll ask him to make me an omelet tomorrow.

177
11:24.220 --> 11:25.440
An omelet?

178
11:25.440 --> 11:26.715
From Ha Ru?

179
11:26.715 --> 11:27.880
Yeah.

180
11:27.880 --> 11:30.976
Remember? You loved them. Said they were really good.

181
11:30.976 --> 11:32.750
Oh, yeah.

182
11:32.750 --> 11:36.832
Yoon Ha Ru... sure makes a great omelet.

183
11:38.293 --> 11:39.777
After Ha Ru injured his knee...

184
11:39.777 --> 11:42.311
and me, my shoulder, and we both quit judo...

185
11:42.311 --> 11:45.774
Everyone was worried about the two idiots who knew nothing other than judo.

186
11:45.774 --> 11:49.526
But we both seem to have found our paths, no?

187
11:50.693 --> 11:52.029
Yeah.

188
11:52.029 --> 11:53.656
I guess so.

189
11:53.656 --> 11:56.320
Yoon Ha Ru has always been passionate about food.

190
11:56.320 --> 11:58.747
Your father's a great cook, too.

191
11:58.747 --> 12:00.167
Maybe that's why,

192
12:00.167 --> 12:02.882
but he's clearly talented at cooking.

193
12:02.882 --> 12:06.046
I really do think he'd become a great chef.

194
12:14.297 --> 12:17.430
Where are we going?

195
12:17.430 --> 12:18.957
Home.

196
12:18.957 --> 12:20.261
Home?

197
12:20.938 --> 12:22.574
Your home?

198
12:23.765 --> 12:25.892
Our... home.

199
12:26.634 --> 12:28.445
Our home?

200
12:28.445 --> 12:29.767
Yeah.

201
12:31.018 --> 12:32.570
Right there.

202
12:33.649 --> 12:34.735
[Happy Home]

203
12:34.735 --> 12:36.833
Wait, this is...

204
12:36.833 --> 12:40.043
the sharehouse that I lived in as a student!

205
12:42.622 --> 12:44.537
Aren't you coming in?

206
12:44.537 --> 12:47.377
Yeah, I'm going in.

207
13:06.846 --> 13:08.288
[Happy Home]

208
13:10.819 --> 13:13.141
[Happy Home - Vacancy Available immediately!]

209
13:28.432 --> 13:30.211
It's just the same!

210
13:30.211 --> 13:33.396
This place hasn't changed a bit, just as I remember.

211
13:44.779 --> 13:46.268
[Jung Woo Jae] [Yoon Ha Na]

212
13:55.384 --> 13:58.200
She's acting a little strange today.

213
13:58.865 --> 14:00.082
Ha Na.

214
14:00.082 --> 14:02.053
Mind if I shower first?

215
14:02.910 --> 14:05.319
Oh, go ahead.

216
14:17.379 --> 14:19.006
What happened here?

217
14:19.006 --> 14:20.331
What is this?

218
14:20.331 --> 14:21.995
Am I...

219
14:22.759 --> 14:25.229
Am I living with Woo Jae?

220
14:52.596 --> 14:54.405
[That Day's Warmth] [World-famous star actress Yoon Ha Na]

221
14:56.042 --> 14:58.346
That's cringe!

222
15:00.058 --> 15:01.552
Wait a minute.

223
15:01.552 --> 15:03.054
If that's the case...

224
15:15.271 --> 15:17.295
This used to be Ha Ru's room...

225
15:17.295 --> 15:19.878
but now it's Woo Jae's, huh?

226
15:21.657 --> 15:22.758
Sorry, sorry.

227
15:22.758 --> 15:26.378
I just need to check something. Just a moment will do.

228
15:36.022 --> 15:37.503
[Etiquette for the toilet]

229
15:55.560 --> 15:56.912
[Practical Theory of Security Services]

230
15:59.304 --> 16:00.661
Why...

231
16:00.661 --> 16:03.699
Why did it have to be security services?

232
16:13.749 --> 16:16.069
[6:00 AM - Wake up 6:30 AM - Breakfast...]

233
16:25.814 --> 16:29.223
Well, something's changed, at least.

234
16:29.223 --> 16:32.314
So that's why you joined the army back then.

235
16:32.314 --> 16:34.856
Because of your father's debt.

236
16:43.986 --> 16:47.032
Sure, it's a shame he's not in the national team,

237
16:47.032 --> 16:49.129
but this isn't half bad.

238
16:49.129 --> 16:52.020
I don't like that he's going to become a bodyguard,

239
16:52.020 --> 16:53.850
but he's only 21.

240
16:53.850 --> 16:56.843
There's plenty of time to change things.

241
16:57.480 --> 16:59.103
I can do this...

242
17:02.254 --> 17:04.436
Ha Na? What are you doing?

243
17:04.436 --> 17:07.094
Oh, I was...

244
17:07.094 --> 17:08.715
looking for my cup.

245
17:08.715 --> 17:09.930
I thought you might've used it.

246
17:09.930 --> 17:12.308
But it's not here.

247
17:12.308 --> 17:13.438
Check in Yoon Ha Ru's room.

248
17:13.438 --> 17:14.541
Yeah, Yoon Ha Ru.

249
17:14.541 --> 17:17.368
Never puts things back in place... yeah.

250
17:22.985 --> 17:24.070
Are you hungry?

251
17:24.070 --> 17:25.473
No!

252
17:26.192 --> 17:28.824
Well, I could go for something.

253
17:28.824 --> 17:30.593
Want some ramyeon?

254
17:31.523 --> 17:36.187
Oh, yeah. If you want to.

255
17:36.817 --> 17:40.193
How about a beer to go with it?

256
17:40.193 --> 17:41.557
Sure.

257
17:54.695 --> 17:58.228
You're being so weird today, Ha Na.

258
17:58.228 --> 18:01.677
Oh, I'm just... happy.

259
18:02.459 --> 18:04.360
- About what? - Us.

260
18:04.360 --> 18:06.082
- Huh? - What?

261
18:10.699 --> 18:12.576
I mean, us,

262
18:12.576 --> 18:13.623
and this beer,

263
18:13.623 --> 18:16.831
and this ramyeon...

264
18:16.831 --> 18:19.970
This night, just good vibes, you know?

265
18:19.970 --> 18:22.565
You get me, don't you?

266
18:22.565 --> 18:24.255
I, well...

267
18:24.255 --> 18:26.437
Yeah, I guess.

268
18:39.518 --> 18:41.274
Anyway...

269
18:42.121 --> 18:44.947
Why do you want to become a bodyguard?

270
18:47.587 --> 18:49.296
I just...

271
18:52.199 --> 18:54.599
I have someone I want to protect.

272
19:01.287 --> 19:03.814
Let me go!

273
19:05.421 --> 19:06.630
What's this?

274
19:06.630 --> 19:07.951
Oh, Bi Gyeong!

275
19:07.951 --> 19:09.710
- And Soo Hyuk, too... - Yeah, hi.

276
19:09.710 --> 19:12.349
How did the after-party go?

277
19:12.349 --> 19:15.003
She's really drunk.

278
19:15.003 --> 19:16.463
Cute.

279
19:16.463 --> 19:19.226
I mean, she's so drunk she'll have to crawl upstairs.

280
19:19.226 --> 19:20.769
Yoon Ha Na.

281
19:20.769 --> 19:25.357
You left the party so early...

282
19:25.357 --> 19:27.526
and you're with Jung Woo Jae?

283
19:27.526 --> 19:30.279
Bi Gyeong, you must be tired.

284
19:30.279 --> 19:31.947
You must be exhausted, too, Ha Na.

285
19:31.947 --> 19:33.365
Should we wrap this up and call it a night?

286
19:33.365 --> 19:35.075
- Oh, yeah. - Good.

287
19:35.075 --> 19:37.930
Here, have a sip.

288
19:41.153 --> 19:43.792
Do you want to go upstairs? I can...

289
19:43.792 --> 19:46.045
Don't touch me!

290
19:46.045 --> 19:47.860
S-sorry.

291
19:48.671 --> 19:50.382
There we go.

292
19:50.382 --> 19:52.475
Let's go.

293
19:52.475 --> 19:54.762
Departing now!

294
19:54.762 --> 19:56.132
Stop!

295
19:57.306 --> 20:02.061
You little punks... You go to sleep on time, you hear?

296
20:02.061 --> 20:03.896
I'll give you a proper scolding...

297
20:03.896 --> 20:05.940
- Yeah, sure... - Go!

298
20:05.940 --> 20:07.691
Good night. Soo Hyuk, you did well.

299
20:07.691 --> 20:09.401
Yeah, good night!

300
20:09.401 --> 20:10.831
Go!

301
20:12.252 --> 20:14.317
- I'll clean up. - Okay.

302
20:19.495 --> 20:21.895
I have someone I want to protect.

303
21:25.894 --> 21:28.564
Woo Jae, your form has greatly improved since last year.

304
21:28.564 --> 21:30.024
You'd do great in practice.

305
21:30.024 --> 21:31.532
Thank you, sir.

306
21:33.569 --> 21:35.320
Let's have dinner sometime soon.

307
21:35.320 --> 21:36.655
Yes, sir.

308
21:36.655 --> 21:37.930
Next team!

309
21:37.930 --> 21:39.508
- Yes, sir! - Yes, sir!

310
21:40.188 --> 21:42.286
[Creating a role] Now...

311
21:42.286 --> 21:45.956
The first thing that an actor should look for...

312
21:45.956 --> 21:49.626
is the character's dream.

313
21:49.626 --> 21:53.630
Something that burns hot in their chest.

314
21:53.630 --> 21:56.030
Also called a super-objective.

315
21:58.177 --> 22:01.597
An actor is someone who dives into a character's life,

316
22:01.597 --> 22:04.847
and rewrites their fate.

317
22:05.976 --> 22:09.188
If one loves the role more than anyone else,

318
22:09.188 --> 22:12.019
- they, by themselves... - Going to the past isn't what swaps our bodies,

319
22:12.019 --> 22:15.040
but we swap each time we time travel.

320
22:15.040 --> 22:17.595
Which means, if we go back to the present now,

321
22:17.595 --> 22:19.810
I'll be Yoon Ha Ru again!

322
22:22.105 --> 22:25.060
[2026: Present]

323
22:27.055 --> 22:31.399
Come to think of it, we've only returned to the present once.

324
22:31.399 --> 22:36.030
We're not stuck like this, lost in the past, are we?

325
22:36.030 --> 22:38.754
[Time travel: body change] We've been jumping so much.

326
22:38.754 --> 22:41.599
So why can't I figure out the pattern?

327
22:51.074 --> 22:52.136
So handsome!

328
22:52.136 --> 22:53.710
- Look at his nose! So sharp! - Unreal.

329
22:53.710 --> 22:54.739
Did you see that?

330
22:54.739 --> 22:57.078
- This can't be real. - So good-looking!

331
22:57.078 --> 22:58.191
How does he do it?

332
22:58.191 --> 22:59.818
He goes to our school?

333
22:59.818 --> 23:01.448
- So handsome! - Who is that?

334
23:01.448 --> 23:03.822
No way he goes to our school.

335
23:03.822 --> 23:05.410
He's so handsome!

336
23:05.410 --> 23:07.543
He's just my type!

337
23:08.694 --> 23:10.386
- He's glowing! - Oh, what do I do?

338
23:10.386 --> 23:11.694
Just as I expected...

339
23:11.694 --> 23:15.145
The judo player Yoon Ha Ru may be lost in time,

340
23:15.854 --> 23:19.405
but my charming presence overthrows the fabric of time and space.

341
23:23.762 --> 23:25.506
Grab him.

342
23:29.268 --> 23:30.580
Who's that?

343
23:31.270 --> 23:32.563
Hey.

344
23:33.272 --> 23:35.896
Time's up. Why are you still here?

345
23:40.320 --> 23:41.844
Wait, then.

346
23:43.198 --> 23:44.783
Our national player is still wrapping up.

347
23:44.783 --> 23:46.975
So, what's he doing?

348
23:46.975 --> 23:48.871
It looks to me like he's sleeping.

349
23:48.871 --> 23:51.039
It's the rule to clear out five minutes before practice.

350
23:51.039 --> 23:52.788
We need to practice.

351
23:52.788 --> 23:54.293
So clear out. Now.

352
23:54.293 --> 23:56.628
What do you even practice with?

353
23:56.628 --> 23:59.381
Do you play tag or something?

354
23:59.381 --> 24:01.941
What did you say? Say it again.

355
24:01.941 --> 24:03.352
Hey!

356
24:07.681 --> 24:09.595
What's all this noise about?

357
24:24.364 --> 24:26.200
Stick to the rules.

358
24:26.200 --> 24:28.776
Oh, my bad.

359
24:33.040 --> 24:35.803
Guess all the judo dropouts like to huddle up in security services.

360
24:35.803 --> 24:37.271
You little...

361
24:43.547 --> 24:46.490
Are your classes treating you well?

362
24:46.490 --> 24:47.817
Yeah.

363
24:49.116 --> 24:50.990
I see.

364
24:52.522 --> 24:54.430
That's good to hear.

365
24:57.269 --> 24:58.948
Aren't you leaving?

366
25:00.442 --> 25:02.464
I am.

367
25:02.464 --> 25:03.816
Don't fret.

368
25:04.821 --> 25:07.347
Guys! Let's move!

369
25:07.347 --> 25:08.850
- Yes, sir! - Yes, sir!

370
25:12.716 --> 25:15.040
Wow, what a joke.

371
25:15.040 --> 25:18.233
Are we just going to let them be?

372
25:18.233 --> 25:20.633
You'd beat him in 3 seconds tops!

373
25:23.590 --> 25:25.259
It's fine.

374
25:25.259 --> 25:26.468
Let's just get ready for practice.

375
25:26.468 --> 25:28.843
- Hey, you. Come here! - Let's not, okay?

376
25:28.843 --> 25:31.056
Let me at them. Hey!

377
25:31.056 --> 25:33.098
That's it for today.

378
25:33.098 --> 25:34.250
See you next class.

379
25:34.250 --> 25:37.067
- Yes, ma'am! - Good work, everyone!

380
25:38.772 --> 25:41.903
Do you want to go eat something?

381
25:41.903 --> 25:44.480
- Yeah, let's go. - Yeah!

382
25:45.237 --> 25:46.905
Guys, wait just a second!

383
25:46.905 --> 25:48.760
Just a moment.

384
25:48.760 --> 25:51.326
The casting results for the short film are here.

385
25:51.326 --> 25:53.495
We've confirmed with the professor.

386
25:53.495 --> 25:56.239
We'll start with the female lead.

387
25:56.239 --> 25:59.534
The short film competition in 2013...

388
26:00.736 --> 26:03.200
The female lead, So Hee, goes to...

389
26:03.200 --> 26:04.464
Yoon Ha Na.

390
26:04.464 --> 26:06.862
Of course, the female lead is Yoon Ha Na.

391
26:06.862 --> 26:09.926
Your face has such good coherence.

392
26:09.926 --> 26:12.306
As for the lens...

393
26:12.306 --> 26:14.536
A '60s Carl Zeiss. That would do nicely.

394
26:14.536 --> 26:16.624
- Congrats. - Haesol's pride!

395
26:16.624 --> 26:19.187
Haesol's princess, Yoon Ha Na!

396
26:19.187 --> 26:22.218
- Thank you. - You need to be the sturdy centerpiece.

397
26:22.218 --> 26:24.021
- Got it? - Yes!

398
26:25.386 --> 26:27.609
The female lead, So Hee, goes to...

399
26:27.609 --> 26:29.131
Please, please...

400
26:31.700 --> 26:33.223
Yoon Ha Na.

401
26:37.122 --> 26:40.167
Of course the female lead is Yoon Ha Na.

402
26:40.167 --> 26:43.670
Your face has such good coherence.

403
26:43.670 --> 26:46.548
As for the lens...

404
26:46.548 --> 26:50.093
A '60s Carl Zeiss. That would do nicely.

405
26:50.093 --> 26:51.428
Wow.

406
26:51.428 --> 26:52.971
Look at Ha Na.

407
26:52.971 --> 26:54.723
Not even a blink, huh?

408
26:54.723 --> 26:57.124
- Congrats. - Congratulations, Ha Na!

409
26:57.124 --> 27:00.237
Haesol's pride, Haesol's princess, Yoon Ha Na!

410
27:05.185 --> 27:08.403
You need to be the sturdy centerpiece, got it?

411
27:08.403 --> 27:10.364
The professor said that you're the one for this role.

412
27:10.364 --> 27:12.791
Oh, of course.

413
27:12.791 --> 27:15.327
This film won four awards at the Busan International Film Festival.

414
27:15.327 --> 27:17.829
Jun Mo won Best New Director at the Grand Bell Awards,

415
27:17.829 --> 27:19.968
and I won Best New Female Lead.

416
27:19.968 --> 27:24.586
It was invited to overseas film festivals and gained a lot of traction, too.

417
27:24.586 --> 27:26.029
Thank you, Jun Mo.

418
27:26.029 --> 27:30.090
Your persona, Yoon Ha Na's life... is back in motion.

419
27:30.801 --> 27:33.419
As for the male lead...

420
27:34.638 --> 27:36.298
it's yet to be announced.

421
27:37.182 --> 27:38.650
As you all know,

422
27:38.650 --> 27:41.228
this role doesn't talk a lot but instead puts weight on action scenes.

423
27:41.228 --> 27:42.893
Which is why I think...

424
27:42.893 --> 27:44.679
maybe we should widen our search.

425
27:44.679 --> 27:47.586
Get applicants from other departments, too.

426
27:49.060 --> 27:53.256
I remember a complete amateur phys. ed student ended up as the male lead.

427
27:53.256 --> 27:54.621
Wait.

428
27:54.621 --> 27:58.067
What if Woo Jae wasn't a bodyguard, but an actor?

429
27:58.067 --> 28:00.238
What if he wasn't the protector,

430
28:00.238 --> 28:02.632
but became someone who gets protected?

431
28:02.632 --> 28:04.751
Physically adept, action-ready,

432
28:04.751 --> 28:08.480
and a dramatic look in the eyes, you get me?

433
28:09.548 --> 28:11.425
- Ha Na? Anything to add? - Jun Mo!

434
28:11.425 --> 28:14.768
Physically adept, action-ready, and a dramatic look in the eyes, right?

435
28:18.232 --> 28:19.772
Yoon Ha Na...

436
28:20.514 --> 28:22.641
That's what I was about to say. Did you just read my mind?

437
28:22.641 --> 28:23.724
You're creeping me out!

438
28:23.724 --> 28:26.978
A tall-as-a-door male lead with a whole story to tell with his back, right?

439
28:26.978 --> 28:30.485
I guess... I understand what half of that means.

440
28:30.485 --> 28:33.061
What do you mean, "tall-as-a-door?"

441
28:35.508 --> 28:39.327
Like, someone with an overwhelming physical presence,

442
28:39.327 --> 28:44.823
and is a heartthrob at the same time and tall...

443
28:45.584 --> 28:48.170
is what they call... people like that.

444
28:48.170 --> 28:50.672
I think.

445
28:50.672 --> 28:52.466
Who says that?

446
28:52.466 --> 28:55.427
I guess it's one of those trendy new words.

447
28:55.427 --> 28:58.593
- Like, "hot stuff" or "ripped chad." - Yeah.

448
28:58.593 --> 29:00.807
Something like that, probably.

449
29:00.807 --> 29:02.017
What are you all amazed about?

450
29:02.017 --> 29:05.312
Kids these days with their nonsense words!

451
29:05.312 --> 29:06.813
Say, "he's well-built,"

452
29:06.813 --> 29:09.191
"he's strong and handsome,"

453
29:09.191 --> 29:10.567
or "he's built like a warrior."

454
29:10.567 --> 29:13.153
See all these perfectly good ways to describe someone?

455
29:13.153 --> 29:15.572
It's just all too much...

456
29:15.572 --> 29:18.450
It's a bit much. Right, Jun Mo?

457
29:18.450 --> 29:20.160
I agree.

458
29:20.160 --> 29:21.953
That's the kind of male lead I want.

459
29:21.953 --> 29:23.371
"Tall-as-a-door!"

460
29:23.371 --> 29:25.040
- Okay. - Yeah, okay.

461
29:25.040 --> 29:27.739
Hey, Ha Na.

462
29:29.838 --> 29:31.878
Can we leave, too?

463
29:39.625 --> 29:42.069
[Yoon Ha Na] I'm here. Come out.

464
29:52.702 --> 29:54.203
Seo Ye Rang?

465
30:04.034 --> 30:06.414
I lost again...

466
30:06.414 --> 30:09.084
Why can't I win just once?

467
30:09.084 --> 30:13.338
I stayed up all night practicing a thousand times, so why...

468
30:13.338 --> 30:16.104
Why can't Seo Ye Rang win against Yoon Ha Na?

469
30:16.104 --> 30:18.863
Wow, she's always been this mad.

470
30:18.863 --> 30:21.645
Everyone's lying when they say working hard is also a talent.

471
30:23.139 --> 30:24.997
It's honestly a curse!

472
30:24.997 --> 30:27.133
Just futile hope.

473
30:30.298 --> 30:32.289
Don't cry, Seo Ye Rang.

474
30:33.400 --> 30:35.151
Keep your head up high, Seo Ye Rang.

475
30:35.151 --> 30:36.545
She's crying?

476
30:36.545 --> 30:38.252
Seo Ye Rang is crying?

477
30:41.533 --> 30:43.647
Why are you crying?

478
30:47.497 --> 30:49.378
Oh, it's you, Yoon Ha Ru...

479
30:50.879 --> 30:53.793
I don't know...

480
31:02.220 --> 31:04.469
I want to be good, too...

481
31:05.888 --> 31:07.508
Oh, this is the moment!

482
31:07.508 --> 31:11.479
- This is when I first met her. - I hate everything!

483
31:11.479 --> 31:13.857
Who did it? Who did this to you?

484
31:13.857 --> 31:15.900
- What the hell? - Who did this?

485
31:15.900 --> 31:18.278
Which bastard was it? Just say the word!

486
31:18.278 --> 31:20.405
I'll take care of...

487
31:20.405 --> 31:23.326
I'll do things! Yeah!

488
31:24.576 --> 31:26.083
Excuse me...

489
31:28.458 --> 31:29.964
What are you doing?

490
31:29.964 --> 31:31.198
What?

491
31:33.668 --> 31:35.180
Wait, something's wrong.

492
31:36.920 --> 31:38.957
Why aren't you cuddling up to me?

493
31:39.688 --> 31:40.930
What?

494
31:40.930 --> 31:46.213
Did you really just ask me... why I'm not cuddling you?

495
31:47.974 --> 31:51.968
What am I supposed to think of this borderline-innovative-loon?

496
31:54.022 --> 31:56.441
You're just so cute, Seo Ye Rang.

497
31:56.441 --> 31:57.942
What?

498
31:57.942 --> 32:01.187
How do you know my name? I've never seen you before.

499
32:02.155 --> 32:06.088
Who the heck are you?

500
32:12.040 --> 32:14.191
Babe, it's me...

501
32:14.191 --> 32:18.290
It's Yoon Ha Ru, whom you had a debilitating crush on back then.

502
32:25.220 --> 32:27.389
Are you a student here?

503
32:27.389 --> 32:30.642
Class of 2013, culinary arts.

504
32:30.642 --> 32:32.435
- How old? - 30...

505
32:32.435 --> 32:35.757
I mean, 21.

506
32:35.757 --> 32:39.534
You rude little thing, how dare you talk to me like that?

507
32:40.819 --> 32:44.072
I guess you've always been aggressive, babe...

508
32:44.072 --> 32:45.657
You!

509
32:45.657 --> 32:48.535
I'll let you off easy this time, because I feel sorry for your delusional head,

510
32:48.535 --> 32:50.269
but if I ever cross paths with you again,

511
32:50.269 --> 32:53.598
I'll show you what true aggression is.

512
32:53.598 --> 32:56.041
So you'd better watch where you're going.

513
32:56.041 --> 32:57.626
Ugh, I should just...

514
32:58.712 --> 33:01.985
I'm pissed off already, I can't deal with this.

515
33:03.174 --> 33:04.300
Why?

516
33:04.300 --> 33:07.387
Why hasn't she fallen in love with me?

517
33:07.387 --> 33:08.596
Why?

518
33:08.596 --> 33:12.475
But I look good today!

519
33:12.475 --> 33:13.874
Why?

520
33:29.110 --> 33:30.956
- Hi. - Gosh, you scared me!

521
33:34.414 --> 33:36.079
There you are.

522
33:37.792 --> 33:40.044
Look who's grumpy.

523
33:40.044 --> 33:42.535
You're so ugly when you frown.

524
33:42.535 --> 33:45.133
I'm sorry, Yoon Ha Ru.

525
33:45.133 --> 33:46.992
This is all my fault.

526
33:46.992 --> 33:50.195
If only I didn't get you injured...

527
33:51.300 --> 33:53.266
Oh, you're moping again.

528
33:53.266 --> 33:56.311
Hey, if I'm being honest, I've had my fair share of judo.

529
33:56.311 --> 33:59.564
No, not even that. I was getting sick of it.

530
33:59.564 --> 34:04.027
From primary school up until I reached 33, that's a long 22 years.

531
34:04.027 --> 34:05.945
I've won every color of every medal.

532
34:05.945 --> 34:08.656
And I already made my way to the top. Global ranking number one.

533
34:08.656 --> 34:10.923
What makes you think I have unfinished business with my judo journey?

534
34:10.923 --> 34:15.079
I would've had my pants in a knot anyway after retiring.

535
34:15.079 --> 34:16.328
Honestly, this is better.

536
34:16.328 --> 34:21.044
Yoon Ha Ru, who's already had the world under his thumb, still 21?

537
34:21.044 --> 34:24.222
I've got so much potential. Yes, I do!

538
34:25.173 --> 34:26.745
But...

539
34:27.491 --> 34:29.594
You know what I always think?

540
34:29.594 --> 34:32.055
You have a tendency to... underestimate me.

541
34:32.055 --> 34:33.681
You think less of me, don't you?

542
34:33.681 --> 34:35.818
When did I do that?

543
34:35.818 --> 34:37.852
If Yoon Ha Ru made a choice at 20 years old,

544
34:37.852 --> 34:39.690
he must've had a good reason.

545
34:39.690 --> 34:41.314
I trust in him.

546
34:41.314 --> 34:43.900
That's why I'll support his choice.

547
34:43.900 --> 34:46.736
You should trust in me, too, and support me!

548
34:46.736 --> 34:49.206
So what's that reason of yours?

549
34:49.206 --> 34:51.574
That's, well...

550
34:51.574 --> 34:53.720
That's for us to find out.

551
34:55.867 --> 34:58.824
You'll muck up your luck if you keep making that face.

552
35:01.084 --> 35:03.413
So, what should we do with Jung Woo Jae?

553
35:03.413 --> 35:05.547
What's his deal? Was he your guard dog in a past life?

554
35:05.547 --> 35:07.048
Why is he so dead set on protecting you?

555
35:07.048 --> 35:08.659
Is that his life's calling, or what?

556
35:08.659 --> 35:10.301
Speaking of...

557
35:10.301 --> 35:12.720
Why are you all serious now? You're freaking me out.

558
35:12.720 --> 35:15.014
I'm going to make Woo Jae an actor.

559
35:15.014 --> 35:16.989
- An actor? - Yeah.

560
35:17.600 --> 35:19.978
Does he want to?

561
35:19.978 --> 35:22.477
We'll make him!

562
35:23.314 --> 35:25.525
- We? - Well...

563
35:27.902 --> 35:29.696
You don't have to help.

564
35:29.696 --> 35:32.407
It's not like you to back down like that.

565
35:32.407 --> 35:34.876
We can try and make it work. Why not?

566
35:34.876 --> 35:36.119
Really?

567
35:36.119 --> 35:39.029
He's my friend, too, you know.

568
35:44.335 --> 35:46.921
- Such a manly body... - But he's got a baby face!

569
35:46.921 --> 35:49.459
- As cool as a breeze... - But as hot as the sun!

570
35:49.459 --> 35:51.521
I can't believe you're real...

571
35:51.521 --> 35:54.053
I'm going to become a fan.

572
35:54.053 --> 35:56.489
This is you, right?

573
35:58.850 --> 36:03.563
I guess that's me, but... What's this about?

574
36:03.563 --> 36:04.939
Nice to meet you!

575
36:04.939 --> 36:07.066
We saw this and we instantly knew it.

576
36:07.066 --> 36:08.092
Knew what?

577
36:08.092 --> 36:09.861
You already belong to the public.

578
36:09.861 --> 36:12.238
It's time for the whole country to fall in love with you!

579
36:12.238 --> 36:13.823
Absolute heartthrob.

580
36:13.823 --> 36:16.242
You're the most handsome guy I've ever seen.

581
36:16.242 --> 36:18.777
You're so, so, so cool!

582
36:20.163 --> 36:21.789
Which is why we made this.

583
36:21.789 --> 36:23.833
Ta-da!

584
36:23.833 --> 36:26.502
[We will protect Jung Woo Jae!] Our day one has already started!

585
36:26.502 --> 36:30.503
- What? - We, the Woo Jae Guardians, will protect you!

586
36:36.924 --> 36:40.055
I have to get to practice, so if you'll excuse me...

587
36:40.055 --> 36:43.102
- Oh, yeah, of course! - Right, uh, please, take this.

588
36:43.102 --> 36:45.021
Right, thank you.

589
36:45.021 --> 36:46.971
He's popular.

590
36:46.971 --> 36:48.274
Yeah, no joke.

591
36:48.274 --> 36:50.778
He's... very popular.

592
36:50.778 --> 36:53.356
- Bye! - Hey, we're leaving.

593
36:53.356 --> 36:56.449
Hey, Woo Jae. Hear that? You're "public domain."

594
36:56.449 --> 36:58.553
Stop teasing me. They're just poking fun.

595
36:58.553 --> 37:00.580
Doesn't seem that way to me.

596
37:01.285 --> 37:03.228
The "Woo Jae Guardians?"

597
37:03.831 --> 37:05.908
Well, I'm convinced.

598
37:05.908 --> 37:08.172
The whole country will fall in love with you.

599
37:08.172 --> 37:10.588
Cut it out, Yoon Ha Ru.

600
37:10.588 --> 37:12.131
I still have another session.

601
37:12.131 --> 37:13.299
See you at home.

602
37:13.299 --> 37:15.700
- Okay, good luck at practice! - Thanks.

603
37:15.700 --> 37:18.131
Oh, you want this?

604
37:18.802 --> 37:19.993
Yes.

605
37:20.640 --> 37:22.308
I'll be going, then.

606
37:22.308 --> 37:24.227
- Bye! - See you!

607
37:24.227 --> 37:26.437
Bye!

608
37:26.437 --> 37:28.147
- We love you! - Goodbye!

609
37:28.147 --> 37:29.440
Love you!

610
37:29.440 --> 37:31.997
- Bye! - Take care!

611
37:33.138 --> 37:34.595
- Is that his girlfriend? - That was unreal!

612
37:34.595 --> 37:35.944
He's so tall!

613
37:35.944 --> 37:38.758
- I think I've fallen for him again! - So handsome!

614
37:40.076 --> 37:41.744
That's not how love works.

615
37:41.744 --> 37:43.369
Hey, you can have this.

616
37:43.369 --> 37:45.206
Okay...

617
37:45.206 --> 37:47.000
Those little brats, they're basically children!

618
37:47.000 --> 37:48.517
I'd like for that to happen to me...

619
37:48.517 --> 37:50.883
What's with their heights, too?

620
37:53.497 --> 37:55.337
You sure you'll be alright?

621
37:55.967 --> 37:57.135
What do you mean?

622
37:57.135 --> 38:00.957
Just one video online, and now he's got a fan club.

623
38:00.957 --> 38:01.982
Once he becomes an actor,

624
38:01.982 --> 38:04.475
there'll be a line of girls wanting to get with him.

625
38:04.475 --> 38:07.770
Would you be able to deal with that?

626
38:07.770 --> 38:08.980
What're you yapping for?

627
38:08.980 --> 38:11.357
Hey, I'm Yoon Ha Na.

628
38:11.357 --> 38:13.474
Crowned Best Actress at Baekryong, every Gen Z's wannabe role model!

629
38:13.474 --> 38:17.196
The icon of sold-out tickets, the undefeated "most datable celeb," Yoon Ha Na!

630
38:17.196 --> 38:18.448
Got it?

631
38:18.448 --> 38:21.156
It doesn't bother me one bit.

632
38:25.121 --> 38:28.666
I see that only four measly "Woo Jae Guardians" have completely broken you.

633
38:28.666 --> 38:30.877
Your face is a sight to see.

634
38:30.877 --> 38:32.634
Shut it.

635
38:35.757 --> 38:38.426
So, you've seen it now. He's got potential.

636
38:38.426 --> 38:40.267
I can feel that something's brewing.

637
38:40.267 --> 38:43.973
I don't think we should let this opportunity pass us by.

638
38:43.973 --> 38:45.691
And opportunities are best when seized.

639
38:45.691 --> 38:47.221
A bit of skill and a lot of luck go a long way.

640
38:47.221 --> 38:49.973
It's all about the right timing. This time...

641
38:51.064 --> 38:54.484
He won't have anyone's back, but instead, he'll be standing up front.

642
38:54.484 --> 38:57.292
Alright. So, what's next?

643
39:00.701 --> 39:03.743
So you have a plan!

644
39:03.743 --> 39:05.702
Let me hear it, too!

645
39:05.702 --> 39:08.112
Come on, just a hint!

646
39:11.354 --> 39:12.379
Hey, try it out.

647
39:12.379 --> 39:13.696
["That Summer, Us" Male Lead Audition] Sounds like fun.

648
39:13.696 --> 39:17.038
Wait, the class of 2008 is Yang Jun Mo's class!

649
39:17.038 --> 39:19.345
- Let's go. - Okay.

650
39:22.511 --> 39:24.842
["That Summer, Us" Male Lead Audition]

651
39:24.842 --> 39:27.034
[Any student at Yongwon University may apply. No prior acting experience needed.]

652
39:40.446 --> 39:41.906
Don't give it away, okay? Act natural.

653
39:41.906 --> 39:44.033
He's quick to pick up on things, you know.

654
39:44.033 --> 39:47.328
Would you stop worrying? Just trust me.

655
39:47.328 --> 39:51.165
People suggested that I become a child actor when I was little and stuff.

656
39:51.165 --> 39:53.256
- Shut up. - I swear!

657
39:54.001 --> 39:57.922
Oh! What is this?

658
39:57.922 --> 39:59.423
Glad you asked!

659
39:59.423 --> 40:02.051
It's a short film that I'm going to be in.

660
40:02.051 --> 40:05.097
But we don't have a good male lead, so there's going to be an audition.

661
40:05.097 --> 40:06.747
Really?

662
40:06.747 --> 40:10.351
This could be the path to fame!

663
40:10.351 --> 40:12.562
Maybe I should give it a shot?

664
40:12.562 --> 40:14.605
You could!

665
40:14.605 --> 40:17.900
Anyone can apply! It's a free audition.

666
40:17.900 --> 40:19.026
An audition?

667
40:19.026 --> 40:22.572
I see!

668
40:22.572 --> 40:26.312
Jung Woo Jae, why don't you give it a shot?

669
40:26.312 --> 40:27.618
Me?

670
40:27.618 --> 40:29.495
No way, I can't do that.

671
40:29.495 --> 40:32.645
Why not? Physically adept, action-ready, and a dramatic look in the eyes. That's you!

672
40:32.645 --> 40:34.000
That's you!

673
40:34.000 --> 40:35.168
Oh, no.

674
40:35.168 --> 40:37.170
An overwhelming physical presence, who's also a heartthrob!

675
40:37.170 --> 40:40.289
There's no denying it, you fit the bill!

676
40:40.289 --> 40:41.733
You!

677
40:42.426 --> 40:44.493
A heartthrob?

678
40:44.493 --> 40:45.702
Me?

679
40:46.512 --> 40:49.515
I mean...

680
40:49.515 --> 40:51.434
The Woo Jae Guardians, they seemed to think that.

681
40:51.434 --> 40:52.726
Ba-dump, ba-dump.

682
40:52.726 --> 40:54.434
Pit-a-pat.

683
40:56.462 --> 40:57.773
No way.

684
40:57.773 --> 40:59.637
I don't know how to act.

685
41:06.532 --> 41:08.409
This is all because your acting sucked!

686
41:08.409 --> 41:11.204
What? I thought I did amazing!

687
41:11.204 --> 41:13.748
Woo Jae, the male lead role's name is Gang Ho.

688
41:13.748 --> 41:16.375
"Gang Ho," because he's such a gangster, and hot!

689
41:16.375 --> 41:19.877
Please, just read the script! Just once!

690
41:25.254 --> 41:27.303
The male lead role's name is Gang Ho.

691
41:27.303 --> 41:29.889
"Gang Ho," because he's such a gangster, and hot!

692
41:29.889 --> 41:33.457
Please, just read the script, just once!

693
41:37.021 --> 41:39.190
- Ha Na... - Woo Jae.

694
41:39.190 --> 41:41.609
Life is a drama, and you're the main actor.

695
41:41.609 --> 41:43.236
Let's quit being Woo Jae the bodyguard,

696
41:43.236 --> 41:45.404
and write an awesome fantasy with me!

697
41:45.404 --> 41:48.065
You'll be Jung Woo Jae, a worldwide star!

698
41:48.866 --> 41:51.077
But Ha Na...

699
41:51.077 --> 41:53.496
My life is more like a documentary.

700
41:53.496 --> 41:55.578
Not a fantasy.

701
41:56.624 --> 41:59.085
See you at home. Bye.

702
41:59.085 --> 42:01.111
Your face is already a fantasy!

703
42:01.111 --> 42:04.831
You should be charged guilty for not putting your looks to use!

704
42:19.038 --> 42:20.659
Yoon Ha Na! Hi!

705
42:20.659 --> 42:23.399
How's your movie going?

706
42:23.399 --> 42:25.486
Oh, the movie...

707
42:25.486 --> 42:29.907
I don't know, it might get scrapped because a certain someone won't play the male lead.

708
42:29.907 --> 42:31.284
Oh, my!

709
42:31.284 --> 42:35.121
What a disaster, oh, no!

710
42:39.626 --> 42:43.508
Oh, these awesome lines and beautiful scenes...

711
42:43.508 --> 42:47.300
I really hoped to let the world see this...

712
42:47.300 --> 42:50.774
How I wish upon the stars for someone to play the male lead!

713
42:52.972 --> 42:55.224
- Ha Na. - Yeah? Why? You'll do it?

714
42:55.224 --> 42:56.854
No, well...

715
42:56.854 --> 42:59.454
You're holding the script upside down.

716
43:04.567 --> 43:06.269
Whatever.

717
43:14.702 --> 43:18.049
I'll apply for the audition, but that's it.

718
43:19.609 --> 43:20.642
Really?

719
43:20.642 --> 43:23.969
You promise, Woo Jae? You'll do it?

720
43:25.002 --> 43:27.173
Don't get your hopes up.

721
43:27.173 --> 43:29.573
- I won't make it. - Oh, yeah!

722
43:29.573 --> 43:31.896
I mean, you'll make it!

723
43:37.975 --> 43:39.751
Do you want to see the script?

724
43:48.569 --> 43:50.488
Good, now turn the light up.

725
43:50.488 --> 43:52.211
Straighten that banner out!

726
43:52.211 --> 43:53.908
[That Summer, Us]

727
43:53.908 --> 43:55.076
Is that good? More.

728
43:55.076 --> 43:56.243
To the right!

729
43:56.243 --> 43:57.536
That's good!

730
43:57.536 --> 44:00.843
Okay, that's good.

731
44:03.856 --> 44:06.080
["That Summer, Us" Male Lead Audition]

732
44:14.678 --> 44:17.539
Kim Jun Woo, physical education, class of 2013.

733
44:17.539 --> 44:20.118
- Here. - This way. Follow me.

734
44:27.733 --> 44:31.723
Hello, everyone! This is Kim Jun Woo, class of 2013!

735
44:45.209 --> 44:48.212
Hello! I'm Gang Li Ho, class of 2013!

736
44:48.212 --> 44:51.540
I'll demonstrate my shadowboxing skills!

737
45:04.770 --> 45:07.690
Hi, everyone! I'm Kim Seong Hoon, class of 2013!

738
45:07.690 --> 45:09.403
I'll be singing a song today!

739
45:09.403 --> 45:12.396
♪ Our paths may diverge time and time again ♪

740
45:12.396 --> 45:14.960
♪ But I'll still wait for you ♪

741
45:14.960 --> 45:17.531
♪ My heart may break beyond repair ♪

742
45:17.531 --> 45:20.075
♪ But I'll still smile for you ♪

743
45:20.075 --> 45:22.261
♪ I may turn away... ♪

744
45:23.873 --> 45:25.583
I'm sorry.

745
45:25.583 --> 45:28.752
I don't think this is working at all.

746
45:28.752 --> 45:30.633
Get him out of here.

747
45:35.708 --> 45:37.178
Greetings, everyone!

748
45:37.178 --> 45:41.305
I'm Han Soo Hyuk, the film department's cutie-patootie, class of 2013!

749
45:41.305 --> 45:43.059
Gang Ho will be mine!

750
45:43.059 --> 45:46.270
Today, I'll act out getting shot!

751
45:46.270 --> 45:48.504
In the middle of a war...

752
45:52.754 --> 45:55.027
Oh, Mother...

753
45:56.230 --> 45:58.806
Mother... I feel something hot on my belly...

754
46:00.170 --> 46:01.524
Oh, boy.

755
46:26.685 --> 46:28.590
Jung Woo Jae is here.

756
46:28.590 --> 46:30.575
Just go over there.

757
46:57.717 --> 46:59.926
Let's see him in action first.

758
46:59.926 --> 47:01.476
Yes, sir.

759
47:03.221 --> 47:07.017
Imagine that he's a threat to the female lead.

760
47:07.017 --> 47:09.417
- Let's see you take him down. - Alright.

761
47:34.295 --> 47:35.808
What in the world?

762
47:45.060 --> 47:46.473
He's an absolute paragon!

763
47:46.473 --> 47:48.446
The cream of the crop!

764
47:49.286 --> 47:51.395
That's Gang Ho, for sure.

765
47:51.395 --> 47:53.439
Yoon Ha Na, and that guy...

766
47:53.439 --> 47:56.843
Their facial structures just complement each other perfectly!

767
47:56.843 --> 48:00.715
I can see them lined up for the ultimate optimal shot!

768
48:01.546 --> 48:03.656
Could you do that once more?

769
48:03.656 --> 48:04.939
Sure.

770
48:16.003 --> 48:18.189
Let's see how you look on camera.

771
48:20.382 --> 48:23.385
Imagine there's someone whom you'd give your life to protect...

772
48:23.385 --> 48:26.892
standing in front of the camera, and look into it.

773
48:28.641 --> 48:31.722
Ready, action!

774
49:12.309 --> 49:13.591
Cut.

775
49:19.358 --> 49:21.882
Have you ever acted before?

776
49:22.903 --> 49:25.280
No, not at all.

777
49:25.280 --> 49:28.024
That's fine. We can make do.

778
49:40.963 --> 49:43.966
I can't believe this!

779
49:43.966 --> 49:46.385
The national judo player, Lee Hyeong Won...

780
49:46.385 --> 49:48.929
he wants to take the audition!

781
49:48.929 --> 49:50.580
- Oh, my god! - What? Lee Hyeong Won?

782
49:50.580 --> 49:52.616
Yeah, Lee Hyeong Won!

783
50:02.855 --> 50:04.876
Right this way.

784
50:16.058 --> 50:18.041
Hi, Yoon Ha Na.

785
50:18.041 --> 50:19.960
I heard you're the female lead.

786
50:19.960 --> 50:22.567
Yeah, I am.

787
50:26.884 --> 50:29.857
I'll play it. Your counterpart.

788
50:42.000 --> 50:45.444
Lee Hyeong Won literally wants to act in our film.

789
50:45.444 --> 50:46.945
This is a great opportunity!

790
50:46.945 --> 50:48.881
What are we even on the fence about?

791
50:48.881 --> 50:53.043
We're guaranteed to go viral if it gets on social media!

792
50:53.650 --> 50:55.621
What do you think, Ha Na?

793
50:55.621 --> 50:57.623
It's your counterpart, after all.

794
50:57.623 --> 51:01.484
I still think that Jung Woo Jae explained the character,

795
51:01.484 --> 51:04.628
and his acting was way better than Lee Hyeong Won.

796
51:05.423 --> 51:07.591
The director will do the explaining,

797
51:07.591 --> 51:09.468
and we can teach him to act.

798
51:09.468 --> 51:13.722
But you need to be born with that star quality.

799
51:13.722 --> 51:15.724
Wouldn't you agree, Director Yang?

800
51:15.724 --> 51:19.228
But still, we shouldn't decide based on what would go viral.

801
51:19.228 --> 51:22.731
I think Jung Woo Jae's acting was superb.

802
51:22.731 --> 51:26.610
I honestly couldn't believe he's an amateur. Gave me goosebumps.

803
51:26.610 --> 51:28.821
Don't you think so, Jun Mo?

804
51:28.821 --> 51:31.907
I think that... Mr. Jung Woo Jae?

805
51:31.907 --> 51:36.782
His actions and acting had that deeply touching element to it.

806
51:36.782 --> 51:38.121
"Mr. Jung Woo Jae?" Really?

807
51:38.121 --> 51:39.540
You rat.

808
51:39.540 --> 51:41.750
This is what's wrong with our society, everything's based on connections.

809
51:41.750 --> 51:43.776
I know you were in the same judo team as him in high school.

810
51:43.776 --> 51:44.950
Is that why you're siding with him?

811
51:44.950 --> 51:46.421
- No. - "No?"

812
51:46.421 --> 51:49.185
You think you're cheeky, huh? Yeah, you've got some cheek right here.

813
51:49.185 --> 51:52.302
Going viral is what makes a film successful.

814
51:52.302 --> 51:56.765
With Lee Hyeong Won's name value added, this film will go places, I assure you!

815
51:56.765 --> 52:00.436
Well, optically speaking...

816
52:00.436 --> 52:03.730
Yoon Ha Na and Jung Woo Jae would make the most visually satisfying pair.

817
52:03.730 --> 52:06.308
So, you prefer Jung Woo Jae?

818
52:06.308 --> 52:08.819
Yeah, but even if we decided on Lee Hyeong Won,

819
52:08.819 --> 52:12.781
I could work my magic with the '62 vintage Zeiss...

820
52:12.781 --> 52:15.341
There's no need to worry.

821
52:23.792 --> 52:25.541
I've made up my mind.

822
52:29.103 --> 52:31.375
- Lee Hyeong Won. - Yes!

823
52:33.719 --> 52:35.616
And Jung Woo Jae.

824
52:39.892 --> 52:41.790
The two will have another audition.

825
52:49.401 --> 52:52.544
That Lee Hyeong Won, or whatever, took Woo Jae's place in the national team,

826
52:52.544 --> 52:55.174
and he wants to meddle with his life again?

827
52:57.914 --> 52:59.022
Jung Woo Jae.

828
52:59.022 --> 53:02.099
I'll train you myself, the best actress of the year.

829
53:05.290 --> 53:06.893
[That Summer, Us]

830
53:09.844 --> 53:11.048
I'll play it.

831
53:11.048 --> 53:12.525
Your counterpart.

832
53:15.425 --> 53:18.086
A callback audition, huh?

833
53:23.470 --> 53:25.741
[Gang Ho approaches So Hee and holds her hand tight, as if he'd never let go]

834
53:26.979 --> 53:29.524
Holding hands is just holding hands.

835
53:29.524 --> 53:31.710
What's with all these "tightly" shenanigans?

836
53:35.877 --> 53:37.906
[Gang Ho embraces So Hee and pats her back. The two are pressed up against each other]

837
53:37.906 --> 53:42.035
"Press up against each other?" What? Why?

838
53:42.035 --> 53:43.745
What's wrong with this director guy anyway?

839
53:43.745 --> 53:45.436
Yang Jun Mo? You...

840
53:49.543 --> 53:52.107
[A long, deep, intimate kiss to confirm their love]

841
53:55.627 --> 53:57.344
"K-kiss?"

842
53:57.344 --> 53:59.011
"A long kiss?"

843
53:59.011 --> 54:01.181
How long?

844
54:01.181 --> 54:02.633
Oh, no.

845
54:04.644 --> 54:08.855
That means Ha Na might have to shoot this with that bastard, Lee Hyeong Won...

846
54:08.855 --> 54:09.975
A deep kiss?

847
54:09.975 --> 54:11.483
Not a peck, a real kiss...

848
54:11.483 --> 54:13.593
A kiss...

849
54:13.593 --> 54:15.362
Not smooching, a kiss...

850
54:15.362 --> 54:17.099
Should I just beg her not to do it?

851
54:17.823 --> 54:20.172
Woo Jae, are you busy?

852
54:21.488 --> 54:22.936
Just a moment.

853
54:26.581 --> 54:27.965
Tightly held hands?

854
54:27.965 --> 54:30.664
Pressing up against each other? A long kiss?

855
54:35.465 --> 54:37.348
Let's do this.

856
54:37.348 --> 54:38.617
Okay...

857
54:47.357 --> 54:49.021
[Scene 1. A lone bus stop, daytime]

858
54:49.021 --> 54:51.843
[Gang Ho says his last goodbye to So Hee]

859
54:51.843 --> 54:53.524
I wish you the best.

860
54:53.524 --> 54:55.692
[So Hee, however...] I'll be going now.

861
54:55.692 --> 54:57.301
[grabs Gang Ho's hand.]

862
54:59.613 --> 55:01.378
Don't go.

863
55:18.970 --> 55:21.202
[Scene 4. The bus stop, daytime]

864
55:21.202 --> 55:26.606
[So Hee cries tears of relief in Gang Ho's arms]

865
55:26.606 --> 55:29.380
[Gang Ho embraces her and pats her shoulder]

866
55:31.188 --> 55:33.220
You need to pat my back.

867
55:52.417 --> 55:54.567
[Scene 6. Road leading out of town, daytime]

868
55:54.567 --> 55:56.725
[The two look at each other]

869
55:56.725 --> 56:00.634
[Gang Ho hugs So Hee, and whispers in her ear]

870
56:00.634 --> 56:02.251
I promise.

871
56:02.928 --> 56:06.775
I'll never leave you all alone.

872
56:34.249 --> 56:37.357
Ha Na, you're great at acting.

873
56:37.357 --> 56:38.830
Yeah...

874
56:38.830 --> 56:41.424
Got a grasp on what emotions you should be conveying?

875
56:41.424 --> 56:44.077
Yeah, I get it too well.

876
56:48.513 --> 56:51.048
I was actually wondering...

877
56:51.952 --> 56:56.128
Do you do everything that the script says?

878
56:57.602 --> 56:59.399
Yeah, that's how it works.

879
57:00.485 --> 57:01.954
Is that so?

880
57:05.532 --> 57:08.034
Well, most of the time, we follow the script as is.

881
57:08.034 --> 57:11.413
But sometimes, we add in more spice on the set.

882
57:11.413 --> 57:13.165
What?

883
57:13.165 --> 57:16.851
Or sometimes, we water it down, too.

884
57:16.851 --> 57:18.582
Oh, okay.

885
57:21.254 --> 57:22.883
Are you angry?

886
57:22.883 --> 57:24.384
Angry?

887
57:24.384 --> 57:27.670
What? No, I'm not.

888
57:35.312 --> 57:37.104
Lee Hyeong Won...

889
57:37.689 --> 57:39.728
must be practicing, too, right?

890
57:43.069 --> 57:44.736
Why?

891
57:44.736 --> 57:46.527
Does it bother you?

892
57:48.074 --> 57:51.908
Let's be honest. He's at an advantage.

893
57:51.908 --> 57:54.114
He's famous, you know.

894
57:54.915 --> 57:56.667
Jung Woo Jae.

895
57:57.751 --> 57:59.449
Don't be scared.

896
58:01.671 --> 58:05.196
The way I see it, you should play Gang Ho.

897
58:05.196 --> 58:07.093
You're Gang Ho himself.

898
58:07.093 --> 58:10.377
So, believe in yourself.

899
58:13.656 --> 58:15.053
Me?

900
58:17.205 --> 58:21.486
But he and I are both amateurs anyway.

901
58:21.486 --> 58:25.150
If we're similar in skill, of course they'd pick the celebrity.

902
58:25.150 --> 58:28.114
Similar? No, he's not even close!

903
58:28.114 --> 58:32.405
Besides, you have something that he doesn't.

904
58:32.405 --> 58:34.162
What?

905
58:34.162 --> 58:37.871
Jung Woo Jae's very own personal coach, Yoon Ha Na!

906
58:40.145 --> 58:43.296
Yeah, you're right.

907
58:43.296 --> 58:45.048
If you can't put faith in yourself,

908
58:45.048 --> 58:47.687
put faith in me, who believes in you.

909
58:48.501 --> 58:49.908
Got it?

910
58:50.720 --> 58:52.069
Okay.

911
59:06.559 --> 59:08.431
In the script,

912
59:09.068 --> 59:11.846
everyone calls So Hee "misfortune."

913
59:11.846 --> 59:16.913
Everyone around her ends up miserable.

914
59:16.913 --> 59:20.000
But letting that fear of the future get a hold of you,

915
59:20.000 --> 59:22.827
and leaving someone you love because of it?

916
59:22.827 --> 59:26.631
I think that's what's most unfortunate.

917
59:26.631 --> 59:30.427
So I do understand Gang Ho, to a degree.

918
59:30.427 --> 59:33.622
I think we have a lot in common.

919
59:35.348 --> 59:39.176
What do you think he'd be like?

920
59:42.460 --> 59:45.699
I think he's someone who always keeps a promise.

921
59:46.345 --> 59:50.291
Even when the whole world changes and turns its back,

922
59:50.291 --> 59:53.716
he'd remember his promise to So Hee and stay by her side.

923
59:53.716 --> 59:55.479
That's who he is.

924
59:56.246 --> 59:57.801
A promise...

925
01:00:00.415 --> 01:00:02.292
I'll confess to you again, properly...

926
01:00:02.292 --> 01:00:04.419
after the trials.

927
01:00:04.419 --> 01:00:05.962
When I make the national team,

928
01:00:05.962 --> 01:00:08.048
and you get admitted to your dream college...

929
01:00:08.048 --> 01:00:10.198
we'll talk again.

930
01:00:14.888 --> 01:00:17.223
Hey, Ha Na.

931
01:00:17.223 --> 01:00:18.767
Yeah?

932
01:00:18.767 --> 01:00:20.068
I...

933
01:00:21.770 --> 01:00:23.772
I have something I need to tell you.

934
01:00:23.772 --> 01:00:26.649
I wanted to say it sooner...

935
01:00:26.649 --> 01:00:27.899
But...

936
01:00:27.899 --> 01:00:30.570
I injured myself after I made the team,

937
01:00:30.570 --> 01:00:32.947
and then got busy applying for college...

938
01:00:32.947 --> 01:00:35.325
and you got into your dream college.

939
01:00:35.325 --> 01:00:36.701
And...

940
01:00:36.701 --> 01:00:38.870
I... I mean...

941
01:00:38.870 --> 01:00:40.330
When I make the national team,

942
01:00:40.330 --> 01:00:41.939
and you get admitted to your dream college...

943
01:00:41.939 --> 01:00:44.206
we'll talk again.

944
01:00:53.258 --> 01:00:54.833
I...

945
01:00:56.846 --> 01:00:58.774
really like you.

946
01:01:01.726 --> 01:01:04.887
I really mean it.

947
01:01:06.981 --> 01:01:09.358
I like you a lot.

948
01:01:09.358 --> 01:01:10.848
Ha Na.

949
01:02:21.431 --> 01:02:22.948
What's going on here?

950
01:03:09.146 --> 01:03:12.079
He keeps trying to take over Woo Jae's place.

951
01:03:12.699 --> 01:03:14.873
Why is he so tangled up in our business?

952
01:03:14.873 --> 01:03:15.897
No way.

953
01:03:15.897 --> 01:03:17.927
I. Yoon Ha Na, 34 years old...

954
01:03:17.927 --> 01:03:19.851
Ha Na!

955
01:03:19.851 --> 01:03:22.146
- He's so confident! - Give me your number!

956
01:03:22.146 --> 01:03:24.350
Is your heart beating yet?

957
01:03:25.410 --> 01:03:28.704
I don't care what you do to me. But...

958
01:03:28.704 --> 01:03:30.811
I won't let you hurt Ha Na.

959
01:03:32.173 --> 01:03:34.799
Hey. What's this?

960
01:03:34.799 --> 01:03:36.823
There's no need to be afraid.

961
01:03:36.823 --> 01:03:38.547
I'll protect you, no matter what.

962
01:03:38.547 --> 01:03:39.884
No!
